1
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:20,020
I was really happy today.

2
00:00:21,187 --> 00:00:24,190
So was I.

3
00:00:26,943 --> 00:00:29,446
A year ago, I never
would've imagined this.

4
00:00:31,614 --> 00:00:33,366
What do you mean?

5
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:36,453
That I'd end up here.

6
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:39,622
You made it happen.

7
00:00:39,622 --> 00:00:41,958
You're an
incredible therapist.

8
00:00:41,958 --> 00:00:44,586
That's only because
I had the best teacher.

9
00:00:47,797 --> 00:00:48,840
Seung-hyun

10
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:53,094
you're not going to
let anything

11
00:00:53,094 --> 00:00:56,056
shake you anymore, right?

12
00:00:56,264 --> 00:00:57,849
Of course not.

13
00:00:57,849 --> 00:01:00,852
Because now
I've got you with me.

14
00:01:00,935 --> 00:01:03,438
Same here.

15
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:06,441
I feel stronger
with you around.

16
00:01:08,276 --> 00:01:09,694
Thank you

17
00:01:11,404 --> 00:01:14,407
Ji-sung.

18
00:01:16,367 --> 00:01:19,329
No, thank you.

19
00:01:20,288 --> 00:01:25,335
Let's keep going, together.

20
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:28,004
Always.

21
00:01:28,004 --> 00:01:31,007
This is just the beginning.
